{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/88d51e902e4029ecb3ad4ffafb57c7d3.avif?t=1770154804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras_big/88d51e902e4029ecb3ad4ffafb57c7d3.avif?t=1770154804 width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Frontier is a fresh look on Real Time Strategy genre. It blends multiple genres into a hot mix of tactics, strategy and roguelike action to create unique player experience with endless replayability. The game features campaign with multiple endings along with battle mode. Welcome back, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.poster.avif?t=1770154804\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.webm?t=1770154804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.mp4?t=1770154804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/7ad6f07463689d0f1f641e574b7d12d5.avif?t=1770154804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras_big/7ad6f07463689d0f1f641e574b7d12d5.avif?t=1770154804 width=800 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy armada is closing on your position from both sides. Establish a base and use all means to protect it. Commander, this is your last Iron Frontier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/8a6b13428d1510906ea65e478abb6e13.avif?t=1770154804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras_big/8a6b13428d1510906ea65e478abb6e13.avif?t=1770154804 width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.poster.avif?t=1770154804\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.webm?t=1770154804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.mp4?t=1770154804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your army from dozens of units and buildings. Command your troops to hit the enemy where it hurts. Use airstrikes and other abilities to rain death on the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/9821be707255559bbc9b0307ca33fd39.avif?t=1770154804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras_big/9821be707255559bbc9b0307ca33fd39.avif?t=1770154804 width=800 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your troops with hundreds of upgrades and power ups. Unlock new units, technologies and permanent upgrades to turn your army into a killing machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/f854572ad14a4386760def2c757751fd.avif?t=1770154804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras_big/f854572ad14a4386760def2c757751fd.avif?t=1770154804 width=800 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate enemy forces with cunning tactics and extreme firepower. Create insane builds to turn the battleground into a kill zone! No prisoners, no survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the battlefield!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2131290?t=1770154804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/23caa0170afeab1cb0499cb39286d354d04c7000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770154804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/13ef2856b3d252fa68db4772b65507702e121dcc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770154804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/13ef2856b3d252fa68db4772b65507702e121dcc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770154804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2286210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/88d51e902e4029ecb3ad4ffafb57c7d3.avif?t=1770154804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras_big/88d51e902e4029ecb3ad4ffafb57c7d3.avif?t=1770154804 width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Frontier is a fresh look on Real Time Strategy genre. It blends multiple genres into a hot mix of tactics, strategy and roguelike action t